IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. 
PROGRAM-ID. MATH-OPERATIONS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-X      PIC 9(3) VALUE 12.
01 WS-Y      PIC 9(3) VALUE 5.
01 WS-QUOT   PIC 9(3).
01 WS-REM    PIC 9(3)

PROCEDURE DIVISION. 
  DIVIDE WS-X BY WS-Y GIVING WS-QUOT REMAINDER WS-REM
  DISPLAY "DIVISION: " WS-X " / " WS-Y " = " WS-QUOT]
          "  (remainder " WS-REM")"
  STOP RUN.
